                {
                  "id": "h-how-we-handle",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "How Sun State International Handles Semi Truck Repairs",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "how-we-handle"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-how-we-handle-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Sun State International is more than a service provider; we're a fleet partner. Our service departments across Tampa, Sarasota, and Davenport are equipped to handle everything from semi-truck repairs to preventive maintenance. Here's how we keep downtime low and quality high:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-how-we-handle-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Diamond Edge Certified technicians for faster check-in, accurate diagnostics, and priority turnaround"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "OEM and aftermarket options to fit your fleet's budget without sacrificing quality"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Straightforward communication: clear estimates and honest timelines"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Dependable parts access: over $3 million in inventory means the part you need is usually in stock"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-proactive-maintenance",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Proactive Maintenance Prevents Repairs",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "proactive-maintenance"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-proactive-maintenance-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Most common repairs start as small issues that were overlooked. Preventive maintenance is the most effective way to avoid breakdowns. By building preventative maintenance schedules based on mileage, duty cycles, and OEM guidelines, fleets save money and improve uptime. Consider adding:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-proactive-maintenance-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Brake checks every 25,000 miles"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Electrical inspections before long hauls"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Cooling system flushes before the summer months"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Quarterly tire and suspension checks"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-proactive-maintenance-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Need help managing a regular schedule? Our service team can help fleets customize preventative maintenance programs that prevent expensive roadside calls and keep trucks compliant.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-ready-to-minimize",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Ready To Minimize Downtime?",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "ready-to-minimize"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-ready-to-minimize-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When it comes to semi truck repairs, you don't just need a shop; you need a partner who understands the pressures of Florida trucking. Sun State International is Florida's only International Truck dealer, but what truly sets us apart is how we care for our customers. As a family-owned business, we prioritize hospitable service, professional care, and straightforward support. Work with a business whose reputation is built on results, and schedule your service with our expert service team today.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
